{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SHINONOME : Rainy Night Manor&quot; is a roguelike game based around the concept of a haunted house from the Japanese Edo period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Yono, in a novice Onyo student. Her main goal is to escape the haunted house alive by escaping from and exorcising the ayakashi (monsters and vengeful spirits).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need action techniques to do this; you need to observe the clues left by the ayakashi, like trails and sounds,  and using them to formulate strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shinonome&quot; is a new type of escape game, wherein you use your courage and mind to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>japanese Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique and terrifying experience as you explore the old Japanese house, which combines rustic beauty with darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>diverse Ways to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw them in and trap them. Set up a trick and run.  Draw in their natural enemies...There are countless ways to take care of the ayakashi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game finds its true beginning when you discover your own way to work through it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>highly Replayable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome to finely detailed haunted house in &quot;Harae&quot;. Escape from a randomly generated haunted house as you work to preserve your tools and food to survive in &quot;Misogi&quot;. Explore the endless dungeons and towers taking short breaks at stores and kitchens inside them in &quot;Gyou&quot;. Each of the games three modes will keep you coming back for more.<br><br><strong>NOTE:</strong> <i>\u201cSHINONOME : Rainy Night Manor\u201d</i> continues its journey toward the official release. Even after launch, WODAN will keep updating and operating it as an ever-evolving game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please stay tuned for the official announcement of <i>\u201cSHINONOME ABYSS : The Maiden Exorcist.\u201d</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kirigami Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/9b7a8577ad4d1137326bc80e32b7ac753eae3b5a.jpg"},{"name":"Mokuroku Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/8726fe2f3b7fa57f2f51be26860ef1f49c3f0c62.jpg"},{"name":"Inka Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/50bdf67a389ead4ee4a8eb483d8f2511fb189a3b.jpg"},{"name":"Menkyo Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/6e580553437c717b5184f36a2a33e9ec43582627.jpg"},{"name":"Kaiden Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/5450b94b12f5907824170f042b0796e72b7ba567.jpg"},{"name":"Hiden Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/046b8902582e24cd9b2f49544619dab58ce49673.jpg"},{"name":"Kuden Exorcist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/9f93645fcba359a9e693bdf29c6d655c3719631c.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Dragon Teacher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/26dcb2794618b96dcd26e90dc888213bbe8a1990.jpg"},{"name":"Resting Dragon Teacher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/3db15f90133c55fc8e599c3e9c637b8ddbcdad52.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Dragon Teacher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1977910/5ac54403509bde0ad6c9c14aa0001ebe2a362ae5.jpg"}],"total":83},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1977910?t=1760625340","background_raw":"https://shared.a